                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rm-h1",
                  "fill": "$color.primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 342,
                  "content": "The Gilded Cage",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rm-sub",
                  "fill": "$color.textMuted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 342,
                  "content": "Midnight Satin • Vol. 1",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Marcellus",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rm-p-0",
                  "fill": "#EAEAEAE6",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 342,
                  "content": "The candlelight trembled against the velvet drapes as the Duke crossed the threshold. Silk whispered under Isolde's fingertips—a vow already half-broken, half-begun.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rm-p-1",
                  "fill": "#EAEAEAE6",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 342,
                  "content": "Beyond the ballroom, the night held its breath. Every glance was a ledger entry; every smile, a debt waiting to come due.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rm-p-2",
                  "fill": "#EAEAEAE6",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 342,
                  "content": "\"You came,\" he said, as if the words themselves were a confession. She did not answer with her voice. The gold of her bracelet caught the light—and the lie between them.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
